            "intro_text": "<p>At COCHIC, our commitments are not set in stone.<br/> They evolve over time, shaped by experience and our desire to keep doing better, at our own scale, year after year.</p><p>We believe that a more responsible fashion industry is possible: more thoughtful, more sustainable, and above all, more human.</p><p>This page outlines the principles that guide our decisions, our concrete actions, and the way we move forward.</p>",
