            "intro_text": "<p>From the very beginning, we chose a different path.</p><p>Rather than producing more and more, we focus on creating better — prioritizing quality, durability, and respect for the people behind every product.</p><p>Our approach is inspired by slow fashion: accessories designed to last, to be worn over time, and to outlive fleeting trends.</p><p>Our flagship product, the collar extender, fully embodies this vision by extending the life of garments and encouraging more responsible consumption.</p><p>We know that responsibility is a journey, not a destination.<br/> That is why we move forward progressively, realistically, and with concrete actions.</p>",
