            "subsection_text_line_height": 1.6,
            "subsection_paragraph_spacing": 10,
            "subsection_1_enabled": true,
            "subsection_1_title": "Comfort & Style",
            "subsection_1_text": "<p>Our products are designed to be comfortable, functional, and elegant. Comfort is central to our vision: a well-designed accessory is one you enjoy wearing every day.</p>",
            "subsection_1_show_icon": true,
            "subsection_1_icon_type": "image",
            "subsection_1_icon_svg": "",
            "subsection_1_icon_image": "shopify://shop_images/flamenco-female-dancer-silhouette-with-raised-right-arm.png",
            "subsection_2_enabled": true,
            "subsection_2_title": "Diversity & Inclusion",
            "subsection_2_text": "<p>COCHIC is a woman-founded and woman-led company. We are certified by <strong>WBE Canada</strong> and <strong>WEConnect International</strong>, which recognize businesses that are owned, managed, and controlled by women.</p><p>Beyond certifications, this commitment is reflected in our everyday choices. We favor partnerships with suppliers who share our values and strive to build working relationships based on respect, fairness, and transparency.</p><p>We believe in diversity, inclusion, and the freedom to be oneself. That is why we are committed to fostering open and respectful environments where every individual is heard, valued, and considered — regardless of identity, background, or origin.</p>",
            "subsection_2_show_icon": true,
            "subsection_2_icon_type": "image",
            "subsection_2_icon_svg": "",
            "subsection_2_icon_image": "shopify://shop_images/inclusion.png",
            "subsection_3_enabled": true,
            "subsection_3_title": "Responsible Innovation",
            "subsection_3_text": "<p>Innovation has been at the heart of COCHIC from the start, from our earliest creations to our patented collar extender system.</p><p>For us, innovating means constantly seeking more responsible solutions, without compromising on quality.</p>",
            "subsection_3_show_icon": true,
            "subsection_3_icon_type": "image",
            "subsection_3_icon_svg": "",
            "subsection_3_icon_image": "shopify://shop_images/responsibility.png",
            "subsection_4_enabled": true,
            "subsection_4_title": "Quality over Quantity",
            "subsection_4_text": "<p>We prioritize quality over volume. Every material and component is carefully selected to create timeless, durable, and long-lasting products.<br/><br/></p>",
            "subsection_4_show_icon": true,
            "subsection_4_icon_type": "image",
            "subsection_4_icon_svg": "",
            "subsection_4_icon_image": "shopify://shop_images/high-quality.png",
            "subsection_5_enabled": true,
            "subsection_5_title": "Environmental Respect",
            "subsection_5_text": "<p>Whenever possible, we favor natural, organic, and handmade materials, and we continuously seek to reduce our environmental impact at every stage.</p>",
            "subsection_5_show_icon": true,
            "subsection_5_icon_type": "image",
            "subsection_5_icon_svg": "",
            "subsection_5_icon_image": "shopify://shop_images/seeding.png",
            "subsection_6_enabled": true,
            "subsection_6_title": "Authenticity & Transparency",
            "subsection_6_text": "<p>COCHIC is, above all, a human company. We make our decisions with honesty, transparency, and consistency — without claiming to be perfect, but with a constant desire to improve.<br/><br/></p>",
            "subsection_6_show_icon": true,
            "subsection_6_icon_type": "image",
            "subsection_6_icon_svg": "",
            "subsection_6_icon_image": "shopify://shop_images/transparency.png",
