            "icon_spacing": 20,
            "heading": "Ethical Production & Long-Term Relationships",
            "heading_color": "#000000",
            "heading_size": 36,
            "heading_size_mobile": 28,
            "heading_line_height": 1.2,
            "heading_spacing": 20,
            "subheading": "",
            "subheading_color": "#666666",
            "subheading_size": 20,
            "subheading_size_mobile": 18,
            "subheading_line_height": 1.4,
            "subheading_spacing": 15,
            "show_key_data": false,
            "key_data_text": "",
            "key_data_color": "#000000",
            "key_data_size": 48,
            "key_data_boxed": false,
            "key_data_border_color": "#000000",
            "key_data_spacing": 20,
            "intro_text": "<p>Ethical production is central to how we work.</p><p>We collaborate with artisans and local partners with whom we build long-term relationships based on trust, respect, and recognition of craftsmanship.</p>",
            "text_alignment": "left",
            "text_color": "#535150",
            "text_size": 16,
            "text_size_mobile": 15,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "paragraph_spacing": 15,
            "intro_text_spacing": 30,
            "subsections_top_spacing": 40,
            "subsections_top_spacing_mobile": 30,
            "subsection_spacing": 30,
            "subsection_spacing_mobile": 25,
            "subsection_icon_size": 24,
            "subsection_icon_color": "#000000",
            "subsection_icon_stroke_width": 1.5,
            "subsection_title_color": "#000000",
            "subsection_title_size": 22,
            "subsection_title_size_mobile": 18,
            "subsection_title_line_height": 1.3,
            "subsection_title_spacing": 10,
            "subsection_text_color": "#535150",
            "subsection_text_size": 15,
            "subsection_text_size_mobile": 14,
            "subsection_text_line_height": 1.6,
            "subsection_paragraph_spacing": 10,
            "subsection_1_enabled": true,
            "subsection_1_title": "Fair Wages & Equitable Conditions",
            "subsection_1_text": "<p>Everyone involved in the production of our products receives fair compensation adapted to local realities and dignified working conditions.</p><p>While we do not yet hold a specific certification in this area, we carefully select partners who share our values and standards of human respect. Some of them are engaged in recognized certification processes such as <strong>OEKO-TEX® STANDARD 100</strong>, <strong>SA8000</strong>, <strong>GOTS</strong>, <strong>UPMADE</strong>, or <strong>Fairtrade</strong>, which serve as complementary indicators in our partner selection.</p><p>We take a progressive approach, continuously improving our practices with the ambition to strengthen this commitment over time.</p>",
            "subsection_1_show_icon": false,
            "subsection_1_icon_type": "svg",
            "subsection_1_icon_svg": "",
            "subsection_2_enabled": true,
            "subsection_2_title": "Artisans, Families & Craftsmanship",
            "subsection_2_text": "<p>We prioritize partnerships with human-scale, often family-run structures that preserve artisanal know-how rooted in their regions.</p><p>For example, we work with a local partner in Italy specializing in exceptional materials, including silk from the Como region. This family business has upheld its craftsmanship since 1945, respecting traditional techniques and material quality.</p><p>We also collaborate with a family of artisans in the Kashmir region of India, who handcraft pashminas and embroidered shawls using ancestral techniques passed down through generations.</p><p>These partnerships are built on trust and long-term collaboration, contributing to the recognition of artisanal trades and local communities.</p>",
            "subsection_2_show_icon": false,
            "subsection_2_icon_type": "svg",
            "subsection_2_icon_svg": "",
            "subsection_3_enabled": false,
            "subsection_3_title": "",
