            "intro_text": "<p>Producing locally also means ensuring that the value created remains within the regions involved and contributes to their economic development.</p><p>Today, approximately <strong>70% of our products are assembled in Quebec</strong>, including our iconic collar extenders. Their assembly is carried out locally with Quebec-based partners and includes final production steps and quality control.</p><p>This percentage may evolve as our collections and production capacities grow, following a progressive and coherent approach aligned with the nature of our products.</p><p>This choice allows us to support local economies, highlight regional expertise, and favor shorter supply chains whenever possible.</p>",
