            "intro_text": "<p>Our environmental commitment did not happen overnight. It is the result of years of research, testing, and collaboration.</p><p>We strive to improve at our own scale by identifying concrete, measurable levers for progress and advancing step by step. This approach is rooted in continuous improvement, where every year matters.</p><p>We are also committed to conveying the intangible value of each creation by highlighting its meaning, origin, and craftsmanship — beyond its simple function.</p><p>We are currently developing <strong>100% compostable packaging solutions</strong>, starting with our upcycled collar extender collection, to reduce environmental impact down to the smallest details.</p><p>In 2025, we took part in the <strong>Parcours Transition écologique 2025</strong> program led by the École des entrepreneurs du Québec, which helped us assess our impact and identify concrete areas for improvement.</p>",
