            "subsection_text_line_height": 1.6,
            "subsection_paragraph_spacing": 10,
            "subsection_1_enabled": true,
            "subsection_1_title": "Responsible, Certified & Revalorized Materials",
            "subsection_1_text": "<p>Whenever possible, we favor recycled, upcycled, or existing material streams.</p><p>Some of the materials used in our products are certified <strong>Global Recycled Standard (GRS)</strong>, which guarantees recycled origin as well as social and environmental criteria throughout the supply chain. These materials are used in selected products, including our <strong>Bottiglia ties</strong>, made from 100% recycled polyester.</p><p>This approach is part of a broader reflection on upcycling and the revalorization of residual materials, particularly around our flagship product.</p>",
            "subsection_1_show_icon": false,
            "subsection_1_icon_type": "svg",
            "subsection_1_icon_svg": "",
            "subsection_2_enabled": true,
            "subsection_2_title": "Concrete Progress Since 2024",
            "subsection_2_text": "<p>Since 2024, all of our regular collar extenders contain <strong>15% recycled resin</strong>, without compromising performance or durability.</p>",
            "subsection_2_show_icon": false,
            "subsection_2_icon_type": "svg",
            "subsection_2_icon_svg": "",
            "subsection_3_enabled": true,
            "subsection_3_title": "Upcycled Collar Extenders from Residual Materials",
            "subsection_3_text": "<p>We have developed upcycled collar extenders made from natural residual materials sourced from existing waste streams rather than virgin resources, including:</p><ul><li>coconut fibers<br/><br/></li><li>recycled plastics<br/><br/></li><li>eggshells<br/><br/></li><li>straw and rice husks<br/><br/></li><li>coffee grounds<br/><br/></li></ul><p>These solutions help reduce waste, limit resource extraction, and offer more responsible alternatives while maintaining high standards of quality and functionality.</p>",
            "subsection_3_show_icon": false,
            "subsection_3_icon_type": "svg",
            "subsection_3_icon_svg": "",
