            "intro_text": "<p>To structure, support, and assess our commitments, we rely on recognized certifications and programs aligned with our responsibility pillars:</p><ul><li><strong>Women-owned and women-led business<br/></strong> WBE Canada, WEConnect International<br/><br/></li><li><strong>Ecological transition<br/></strong> Parcours Transition écologique 2025 – École des entrepreneurs du Québec<br/><br/></li><li><strong>Responsible materials<br/></strong> Global Recycled Standard (GRS), where applicable<br/><br/></li></ul><p>We view these frameworks as tools for progress rather than an end goal. They help us move forward with rigor, structure our approach, and strengthen transparency.<br/></p>",
